Awa ni natte kieru

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.200
Kiweu

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:35.870
Sorezore no basho e

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:44.380
Hirameki hishimeki au yuugou shite

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.840
Kono karada wa hitotu de

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:53.010
Hitotu no you de mugen de

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:56.430
Koboreochita shizuku wo

00:22:56.430 --> 00:23:02.440
lma kakagete miteru yo

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.070
Mebae Drive

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:09.530
Hashire sky hadashi no mama

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.740
Hora me wo tsubutte utsuridashuta

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.910
Niji no hashi e yukou

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.580
Mebae Drive

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:22.920
Terasu spark kudaketa hoshi

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:31.130
Sora ni chiribame ochiteku
hitokakera no yume wo

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:37.930
Te ni tsukanda hikari wo

00:23:37.970 --> 00:24:09.080
Next Episode

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.100
Did you make teru-teru-bozu dolls?

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:46.230
I did, before school trips and sports events.

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:49.400
I thought it was pointless to
refuse natural phenomena.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.780
I woke up early, and I also carried
a different backpack to school.

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.620
I traded some of the stuff in
my lunchbox with others.

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.450
I'm getting excited.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.200
Stop and leave the rest for the next episode.

00:23:59.290 --> 00:24:03.290
Next Episode is
''October 12th: Stormy Drying Agent''

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:07.630
We'll be waiting at the Hidamari Apartments,
so please, join us again.
